class: runtime
profiles: standard
summary: every socket option of net.network set and read back on a listener, a connection and a datagram socket of each family through hosted/blocking and hosted/events: reuse_address, keep_alive and broadcast on and off, ipv6_only on from the start for IPv6 and io_failed for IPv4, buffers at least what was set, unicast and multicast hops, the keep-alive spans in whole seconds rounded up, and linger on and off; reuse_port where the system has it and unsupported on Windows
program: main.ldn
root: ../../../../..
status: 42
constructs: 0680, 0940, 1030, 1660
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, linux-rv64, darwin-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, windows-x86-64, windows-arm64
